      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Something else that might work is worlds based on friend groups using the favourite friend feature.\n\nFor example, setting the world to Favourite and selecting group one--only people from that group can join. Then Favourite+, in turn would allow those people to invite others.\n\nJust using Invite and Invite+ is a bit inconvenient, especially if you're playing with a larger social circle.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
